  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to The Pink Flamingo, a charming vacation home located in Inlet Beach, Florida. This beautifully designed retreat features three bedrooms and two and a half bathrooms, making it an ideal choice for families or small groups. Just 0.08 miles from the beach, you’ll enjoy easy access via a nearby pedestrian underpass that makes crossing Highway 98 a breeze. Highlights include a spacious open concept living and dining area, a large, paved parking area, a fenced backyard with a pergola, a gas grill and an inviting outdoor dining space, perfect for relaxing after a day in the sun.<br><br>Inside, the fully equipped kitchen offers everything you need to prepare anything from a quick beach snack to a full gourmet dinner. With ample counter space, modern appliances, and all the cookware and utensils provided, you’ll find mealtime a breeze whether you're entertaining guests or enjoying a quiet night in.<br><br>The Pink Flamingo comfortably accommodates guests with three well-appointed bedrooms. Each room is thoughtfully arranged to ensure restful nights and relaxing mornings, offering a mix of sleeping arrangements ideal for families or groups of friends.<br><br>Guests of The Pink Flamingo also enjoy access to a nearby community pool, just a short walk from the home. Whether you're looking to take a refreshing swim or simply soak up the sun poolside, this shared amenity adds even more enjoyment to your stay.<br><br>Situated within walking distance of a vibrant area known for its upscale shopping and dining, the home offers the perfect balance of relaxation and activity. Enjoy a peaceful residential setting while being just moments from local attractions, scenic walking paths, and the sparkling Gulf waters.<br><br>Don’t miss your chance to unwind and make unforgettable memories at The Pink Flamingo. Book your stay today and start planning your perfect Inlet Beach escape!<br><br>Clean Cover Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
